<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1592_5761.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> willig dienst, und was wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrer</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>liebs und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegen</unclear> zuovor, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">FromFuersichtig</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ehr</unclear>-
<lb n="3"/>sam Weyß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Insonnders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getreue</unclear> lieb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nachbarn</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/>Unß hat unnsere <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">landtmaennin</unclear>, <persName resp="#ner">Anna <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Vetterj</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weyßern</unclear> diß
<lb n="5"/>brieffs zuerkennen geben, wie das vor etlichen wuchen, der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weyn</unclear>-
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schenckh</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüwers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Spittals</unclear> N: <persName resp="#ner">Spengler</persName>, todes abgestorben sige,
<lb n="7"/>Zuo dessen verlassenschafft, sy nebend <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">andern</unclear>, auch ein erb sie,
<lb n="8"/>nit weniger <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> ihr der <persName resp="#ner">Anna <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vetterin</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwoester</unclear>, <persName resp="#ner">Dorothea
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schluenpffin</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüwre</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">buergerin</unclear>; <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diewyl</unclear> er, in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">naeherem</unclear> grad, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lybß</unclear>-
<lb n="10"/>erben, hinder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> nit verlassen habe; <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Diewyl</unclear> aber etwas
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedenckhens</unclear> entstanden, das sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihm</unclear> ehestandt nit solte <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geboren</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>syn; habe sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihre</unclear> liebe <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">basen</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Margrethen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vetterin</unclear></persName>, (die auch
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegenwertig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ware</unclear>) darumb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> unß gestelt; <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dero</unclear> wol in
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wissen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> ihr lieber vatter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">s</unclear>: <persName resp="#ner">Herman <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Vetter</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihrre</unclear> auch
<lb n="15"/>lieber muoter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">s</unclear>: <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vibraten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Spenglerin</unclear></persName>, die ehe versprochen
<lb n="16"/>habe, und aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwan</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyter</unclear> gestorben, ehe das er selbige ver-
<lb n="17"/>sprochne ehe, mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">offentlichem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kilchgang</unclear> habe <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bestaettigen</unclear> lassen
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">koennen</unclear>; Nichtsdestoweniger habe er in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">synem</unclear> todbeth begert,
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> sy ordenlicher weyß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moechten</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehleüthen</unclear> zesamen geben
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>, das dan auch beschehen, sovil rechte ordnung habe er-
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lyden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moegen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diewil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Anna</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iez</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">3</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getragen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hab</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Darumben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermeint</unclear> sy, das sy auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> ein
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehekhindt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solte</unclear> gehalten und geachtet, und hiemit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> erben,
<lb n="23"/>neben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">andern</unclear>, erkendt werden; Wan dan ihr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dise</unclear> sach, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">disen</unclear> tagen
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoerfahren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gsinnet</unclear>, Sie ihr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">demuetig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear> an unß, das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihro</unclear> mit unser intercession an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuerdersam</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woelten</unclear>;
<lb n="26"/>Wan wir unß dan <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solches</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zethuon</unclear> schuldig erkendt, So ist
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlichen</unclear> bitten an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear>, ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear> offt-
<lb n="28"/>gedachte <persName resp="#ner">Annam <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vettern</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> befolhen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear> lassen, und uff
<lb n="29"/>dise <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khundschafft</unclear> und sag, so ermelte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihre</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">baß</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Margreth</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vettern</unclear></persName>
<lb n="30"/>selbsten in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyblicher</unclear> form, vor unß gethon, wie oben ge-
<lb n="31"/>meldet, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebuerender</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maassen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">also</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> gegen ihro
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1592_5762.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erzeigen</unclear>, das sy diser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unserer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuegschrifft</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fruchtbarlichs</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gnossen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuehaben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">spueren</unclear>, und dasselbige <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhuemen</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moege</unclear>. Das begeren wir umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> und die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euweren</unclear>
<lb n="35"/>in dergleichen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehrerem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> zuverdienen. Und
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thund</unclear> unß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sambtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Goetlicher</unclear> protection <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anbefelchen</unclear>
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daby</unclear> den. <origDate when="1608" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">21</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Januarii</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ao</unclear>. 1608</origDate>.
<lb n="38"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-506" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Lanndtaman unnd Raath
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> Appenzell</orgName>. etc.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1592_5763.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1592_5764.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Denen</unclear> frommen fuersichtigen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehr</unclear>-
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">samen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weisen</unclear>, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermaister
<lb n="42"/>und Rath der Statt Sant Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">innsonders</unclear> gueten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründen</unclear>,
<lb n="44"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getreüwen</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbaren</unclear>.
</p>
